  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/cleaningbot1/text",
      "value": "These monsters are found cleaning away in Scorched City biomes. Since most of them have never received maintenance, their outer exterior has deteriorated quite a bit."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/cleaningbot1/text",
      "value": "これらの怪物は、スコーチドシティの生物群集で発見されている。 ほとんどがメンテナンスを受けていないため、外装はかなり劣化しています。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/cleaningbot2/text",
      "value": "Despite this, they still miraculously carry on with their primary function. They don't tolerate anyone hindering their cleaning, and are prone to attacking anyone that gets too close."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/cleaningbot2/text",
      "value": "それにもかかわらず、彼らはまだ彼らの主な機能で奇跡的に続きます。 彼らは清掃を妨げる人を容認せず、近づきすぎる人を攻撃しがちです。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/cleaningbot3/text",
      "value": "Supposedly, some people have reported acquiring Roombas in mint-condition, though they never elaborate on where they caught them, and such units are likely fairly rare."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/cleaningbot3/text",
      "value": "ミントコンディションでRoombasの買収を報告した人もいるが、どこでそれを捕まえたのかは決して詳しく説明していない。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/cottonbop0/text",
      "value": "MONSTER: Cottonbop - FAMILY: Bulbop - BIOMES: Garden - Notes: Can be harvested"
