  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/cottonbop1/text",
      "value": "Cottonbops are non-aggressive relatives to the Bulbop found in Garden biomes. They are capable of limited 'flight' due to their ability to trap air in their cotton fibres, and drift along wind currents."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/cottonbop1/text",
      "value": "コットンボップは、ガーデンバイオームで見つかったバルボップと非攻撃的な親戚です。 彼らは綿繊維に空気を閉じ込め、風の流れに沿って漂う能力のために「飛行」を制限することができます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/cottonbop2/text",
