  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/crustoise1/text",
      "value": "These monsters are covered in painfully sharp rocks. Though they look cute, they're highly territorial."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/crustoise1/text",
      "value": "これらのモンスターは、痛いほど鋭い岩で覆われています。 可愛いのに、とても準州的なの。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/crustoise2/text",
      "value": "These little guys are famous for raising up on their hind-legs and charging at their targets. It's thought they do this to scare off intruders."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/crustoise2/text",
      "value": "これらの小さな男は、後ろ足で育て、ターゲットで充電することで有名です。 侵入者を怖がらせるためだと考えられています"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/crutter0/text",
      "value": "MONSTER: Crutter - FAMILY: Crutter - BIOMES: Mixed"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/crutter0/text",
      "value": "モンスター:クラッター - 家族:クラッター - バイオームズ:ミックス"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/crutter1/text",
      "value": "Crutters possess an extremely potent toxin. Just a drop of Crutter toxin can inflict poison."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/crutter1/text",
      "value": "砕石は非常に強力な毒素を有する。 クラッター毒素のほんの一滴は毒を誘発することができます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/crutter2/text",
      "value": "They should be approached with caution, as they can utilize their toxin as a projectile."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/crutter2/text",
      "value": "毒素を発射体として使用できるため、慎重にアプローチする必要があります。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/electrix0/text",
      "value": "MONSTER: Electrix - FAMILY: Fennix - BIOMES: Scorched, Scorched City - Notes: Can be harvested"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/electrix0/text",
      "value": "モンスター:エレクトリックス - 家族:フェニックス - バイオームス - 焦げた、焦げた都市 - メモ:収穫することができます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/electrix1/text",
      "value": "Electrix are members of the Fennix family. They are often found in Scorched environments, hunting for abandoned sources of electricity that may still be active."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/electrix1/text",
      "value": "エレクトリックスはフェニックス家のメンバーである。 それらはしばしば、まだ活動している可能性がある放棄された電気源を狩って、焼けた環境の中で見つけられます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/electrix2/text",
      "value": "When threatened, they can charge their breath with electricity, and shock their target."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/electrix2/text",
      "value": "脅威にさらされると、彼らは電気で息を充電し、ターゲットにショックを与えることができます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/eyevalve0/text",
      "value": "MONSTER: Eyevalve - FAMILY: Eyevalve - BIOMES: Ocean Floor"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/eyevalve0/text",
      "value": "モンスター:アイバルブ - 家族:アイバルブ - バイオーム:オーシャンフロア。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/eyevalve1/text",
      "value": "Eyevalves are two separate monsters working together in a symbiotic relationship. The clam is blind, and has issues locating prey on their own. The Aqueye is highly vulnerable, but has excellent vision."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/eyevalve1/text",
      "value": "アイバルブは、共生関係の中で一緒に働く二つの別々のモンスターです。 アサリは盲目であり、それ自体で獲物を見つけるのに問題があります。 Aqueyeは非常に脆弱ですが、優れたビジョンを持っています。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/eyevalve2/text",
      "value": "The monsters overcome each other's weaknesses and shortcomings by teaming up. The Aqueye locates prey, and the clam provides the Aqueye with protection."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/eyevalve2/text",
      "value": "モンスター同士がチームを組んで、お互いの弱点や欠点を克服します。 Aqueyeは獲物を見つけ、アサリはAqueyeに保護を提供します。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/eyevalve3/text",
      "value": "When an Eyevalve is defeated, the Aqueye is left behind. Aqueye are very weak, and virtually defenseless on their own"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/eyevalve3/text",
      "value": "アイバルブが敗北すると、アクアイは取り残されます。 Aqueyeは非常に弱いです。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/eyevalve4/text",
      "value": "It would take quite a cruel person to destroy the symbiotic bond of an Eyevalve."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/eyevalve4/text",
      "value": "アイバルブの共生結合を破壊するには、かなり残酷な人が必要です。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/fennix0/text",
