  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi0/text",
      "value": "MONSTER: Gummi - FAMILY: Gummi - BIOMES: Forest"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi0/text",
      "value": "モンスター:グミ-家族:グミ-生物:森"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi1/text",
      "value": "Gummis are a gelatinous monster native to forests. They get their name from a gelatinous substance produced in their bodies."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi1/text",
      "value": "グミは、森に生息するゼラチン質の怪物です。 名前の由来は体内で生産されるゼラチン性物質から。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi10/text",
      "value": "The latter is possible, due to the substance's incredible ability to replicate and mirror DNA of organic matter that comes into contact with it. This alone makes it a highly useful resource."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi10/text",
      "value": "後者は、有機物のDNAを複製してミラーリングする物質の信じられないほどの能力のために可能です。 これだけでも非常に有用なリソースになります。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi2/text",
      "value": "Gummis are technically docile, but their inability to control their excitement when they meet new lifeforms makes them dangerous."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi2/text",
      "value": "グミは技術的には不快ですが、新しい生活様式に出会うと興奮をコントロールできなくなるため、危険です。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi3/text",
      "value": "When a Gummi spots a new lifeform, they make an audible squeak. It's thought this squeak is a release of air bubbles trapped within their bodies."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi3/text",
      "value": "グミが新しい生命体を見つけると、音が鳴ります。 この音は、体の中に閉じ込められた気泡の放出だと考えられています。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi4/text",
      "value": "They are obsessed with making close physical contact with lifeforms, and aren't afraid to throw their bodies around to do so."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi4/text",
      "value": "彼らは生命体と密接な物理的接触をすることに集中しており、それを行うために自分の体を投げるのを恐れていません。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi5/text",
      "value": "It is thought they may just simply want to make new friends. When captured, they make great pets."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi5/text",
      "value": "単に新しい友達を作りたいだけかもしれないと考えられています。 捕らえられると、彼らは偉大なペットを作ります。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi6/text",
      "value": "Gummis are asexual, and never stop growing. When they reach a certain size, they become capable of producing offspring. At this stage they are called Mama Gummis."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi6/text",
      "value": "ガムは無性愛者であり、決して成長を止めることはない。 一定のサイズに達すると、子孫を産むことができるようになります。 この段階では、ママ・グミスと呼ばれます。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi7/text",
      "value": "The size of the Gummis produced depends on the size of the Mama. Mama Gummis behave like average Gummis, but are far more bulky, and can throw more weight around."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi7/text",
      "value": "製造ガミのサイズは、ママのサイズによって異なります。 ママ・ガミスは普通のガミスのように振る舞うが、はるかにかさばり、重量を多く投げることができる。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi8/text",
      "value": "The small gummis produced by Mamas of a standard-size are called Gumminis. The vibrant colors of the adults aren't as present in Gumminis. Their size often makes them a difficult target."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/scenes/gummi8/text",
